# DimArch OS — allow the desktop user to hibernate without password.
#
# systemctl hibernate goes through logind CanHibernate() which fails in systemd 261
# (ENOENT — cannot verify swap file offset from logind sandbox). Workaround: call
# hibernate.target directly, bypassing logind. dimarch-sleep uses this rule.
#
# USERNAME is substituted by setup-hibernate.sh from dimarch.conf [system] username.
# Deploy: install -m 440 dimarch-hibernate-nopasswd.sudoers \
#                         /etc/sudoers.d/dimarch-hibernate
__USERNAME__ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/systemctl start hibernate.target
